[00:11.32]1. O Jehovah, Sov’reign Ruler,
[00:22.65]You are the one I love and obey.
[00:34.94]You deserve my full devotion;
[00:40.44]You are my God; I’ll serve you each day.
[00:46.44]Your commands I loyally follow;
[00:52.94]How I love reminders from you!
[01:00.09](Chorus)
[01:02.99]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[01:05.89]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.
[01:08.79]2. Father, all your works exalt you.
[01:28.99]Earth, moon, and stars your glory proclaim.
[01:36.99]May I also be as faithful,
[01:42.99]Using my strength to make known your name.
[01:50.30]May I use my whole life to serve you,
[01:56.30]Proving to be loyal and true.
[02:03.93](Chorus)
[02:09.43]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[02:35.52]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.